sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as User
  participant UI as Workspace Chat UI
  participant Store as Vue Reactive Store
  participant Server as Backend Server (server.ts)
  participant Repo as Companion Repository
  participant ToolExec as ToolExecutor (tool-executor.ts)
  participant Adapter as Provider Adapter (Gemini/OpenAI/Claude)
  participant Provider as Remote AI Provider

  User->>UI: Submit Message ("Check memory and change expression to happy")
  UI->>Store: sendChatMessage(text)
  Store->>UI: Append optimistic user message
  Store->>Server: POST /api/v1/chat/completions { message, agentId }
  
  Server->>Repo: Persist User Message to DB
  Server->>Repo: Fetch active Agent, enabled Skills, prioritized Rules, and relevant Memories
  Server->>ToolExec: Enrich active Tools schema & descriptions
  Server->>Server: Compose deterministic Multi-Layer System Prompt & Tool Schemas
  Server->>Server: Fetch bounded conversation history (last 12 turns)
  Server->>Server: Initialize 30s AbortController & client disconnect listener
  
  Server->>Adapter: generateChatResponse(apiKey, requestWithSignal)
  Adapter->>Provider: HTTPS POST (Secret in Header, finite timeout)
  Provider-->>Adapter: 200 OK (Model outputs structured tool_call block)
  Adapter-->>Server: ChatCompletionResponse with tool_call payload

  opt Model requests Tool Call
    Server->>ToolExec: execute(userId, toolId, { args, confirmed: false })
    alt Tool requires confirmation and unconfirmed
      ToolExec-->>Server: { success: false, error: "confirmation_required" }
      Server->>Server: Record tool request needing user approval
    else Tool authorized & validated
      ToolExec->>ToolExec: Validate schema arguments & execute handler with 5s timeout
      ToolExec-->>Server: { success: true, result: { applied: true, expression: "happy" } }
      Server->>Server: Append tool execution result to prompt context
      Server->>Adapter: generateChatResponse(follow-up conversational turn)
      Adapter->>Provider: HTTPS POST with tool execution result
      Provider-->>Adapter: Final synthesized companion message
      Adapter-->>Server: ChatCompletionResponse
    end
  end

  Server->>Repo: Persist Assistant Message to DB
  Server-->>Store: 200 OK { message, userMessage, usage, toolExecutions }
  Store->>UI: Append assistant message & trigger any Stage visual reaction
